a Foundation, we focus on creating sustainable change through three core programs that address the most pressing challenges faced by women and girls in Tanzania.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"49aa314b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"37f1026f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"33c80e68\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"WASH Program\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"394521b2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Menstrual hygiene remains a significant barrier for