"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"259e0792\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"100\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e45b5a4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":120,\"sizes\":[]},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2caa92be\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":30},\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6b41d07c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Transforming<br> Communities\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"63b1c2b8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7b773502\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Our programs are designed to address the unique challenges. By focusing on menstrual hygiene, economic empowerment, and gender equality, we are creating opportunities for women to lead healthier, more fulfilling lives.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"45dad324\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2b4daf16\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"31788b0d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7ca24cd7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.fursafoundation.org\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/img2.jpg\",\"id\":114,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":500,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"cover\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5ce73744\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"358fdfd4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Our Commitment to Change.\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"441eb6d7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>At Fursa Foundation, we believe that sustainable change begins with empowering women and girls. Through our three core programs, we address the most pressing challenges they face, from menstrual health to economic empowerment and safety. <br \\/><br \\/>Each program is designed to provide practical solutions, education, and opportunities, ensuring that every woman and girl we reach is equipped to lead a healthy, productive life.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Work Sans\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7775126b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"415b85ab\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"53292f2e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_wrap\":\"wrap\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"57cba6de\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"100\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5d87b67a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"5d303a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"Our Programs\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"800\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"10417a8a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>At Fursa Foundation, we focus on creating sustainable change through three core programs that address the most pressing challenges faced by women and girls in Tanzania.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"49aa314b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"37f1026f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"33c80e68\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"WASH Program\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"394521b2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Menstrual hygiene remains a significant barrier for many girls and women in Tanzania, often leading to missed school days and limited opportunities.<\\/p><p>Through our WASH Program, we provide reusable sanitary pads, menstrual hygiene education, and safe water solutions, empowering girls to manage their periods with dignity.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"07983b7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Key Initiatives:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Distribution of reusable sanitary pads to schoolgirls and women.<\\/li><li>Menstrual hygiene education workshops to raise awareness and knowledge.<\\/li><li>Empowering women through training in pad production and entrepreneurship.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-13\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"6ec854a9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"eleme