menstrual hygiene products, limited economic opportunities, and the prevalence of gender-based violence were holding back women and girls from reaching their full potential. <br \\/><br \\/>With a shared vision of creating a healthier, more equitable society, we established Fursa Foundation to address these challenges head-on. <br \\/><br \\/>Today, we\\u2019re proud to be making a difference in the lives of thousands of women and girls across Tanzania, one step at a time.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"57d9027\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"text\":\"Read Our Story\",\"align\":\"left\",\"text_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Anek Malayalam\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.fursafoundation.org\\/about-us\\/\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"Hi, I\'m a global tooltip.\",\"premium_tooltip_position\":\"top,bottom\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"98bcaf6\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"pa_condition_repeater\":[],\"premium_tooltip_text\":\"