-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n		<p>© 2024 Fursa Foundation. All right reserved</p>', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '19-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-14 12:14:42', '2024-10-14 12:14:42', '', 19, 'https://www.fursafoundation.org/?p=259', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(260, 1, '2024-10-14 12:14:44', '2024-10-14 12:14:44', '<p>Together, we\'re breaking barriers, uplifting communities, and creating opportunities for a brighter, more equitable future.</p>		\n			<h2>Discover how we’re building a brighter future for women and girls in Tanzania.</h2>		\n			<h2>From Passion <br>to Purpose</h2>		\n		<p>Fursa Foundation was born out of a shared vision among young medical doctors to create a healthier, more equitable future for women and girls in Tanzania. Our journey began in 2021, and since then, we’ve been working tirelessly to empower underserved communities and transform lives.</p>		\n						Jan, 2021\n							<h2>Foundation Established</h2>\n							<p>Officially registered as a community-based organization, focusing on menstrual hygiene, women’s empowerment, and gender equality.</p>						\n						April, 2022\n							<h2>Launch of WASH Program</h2>\n							<p>We initiated the WASH Program, distributing reusable sanitary pads and providing menstrual hygiene education to hundreds of girls in Mwanza.</p>						\n						Feb, 2023\n							<h2>Expanding Impact</h2>\n							<p>Introduced entrepreneurship and digital skills training through our Women Empowerment Program, reaching more than 300 women.</p>						\n						Present\n							<h2>Standing Against GBV</h2>\n							<p>Our Ending Gender-Based Violence program now works with youths, schools, and local leaders to promote respect and equality, impacting thousands of lives.</p>						\n					<button type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M34.52 239.03L228.87 44.69c9.37-9.37 24.57-9.37 33.94 0l22.67 22.67c9.36 9.36 9.37 24.52.04 33.9L131.49 256l154.02 154.75c9.34 9.38 9.32 24.54-.04 33.9l-22.67 22.67c-9.37 9.37-24.57 9.37-33.94 0L34.52 272.97c-9.37-9.37-9.37-24.57 0-33.94z\"></path></svg></button>\n					<button type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"></path></svg></button>\n			<h2>What We Stand For</h2>		\n		<p>We envision a world where gender equality is the norm, where no girl misses school due to lack of menstrual hygiene products, and where women have the skills and opportunities to achieve their dreams.</p>		\n													<img width=\"635\" height=\"423\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg 635w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 635px) 100vw, 635px\" />													\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1880\" open>\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1880\" >\n					 Our Mission \n						</summary>\n							<p>To create a positive impact in our communities through multisectoral involvement, providing essential resources, education, and support to help women and girls reach their full potential.&#8221;</p>						\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1881\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1881\" >\n					 Our Vision \n						</summary>\n							<p>A healthy, responsible, and productive community where every woman and girl has the opportunity to thrive.&#8221;</p>						\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1882\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1882\" >\n					 Our Values \n						</summary>\n							<p>Our values—unity, passion, innovation, equality, and development—guide everything we do. They shape our programs, partnerships, and engagement with our community.</p>						\n					</details>\n		<p>To create a positive impact in our communities through multisectoral involvement, providing essential resources, education, and support to help women and girls reach their full potential.\"</p><p>A healthy, responsible, and productive community where every woman and girl has the opportunity to thrive.\"</p><p>Our values—unity, passion, innovation, equality, and development—guide everything we do. They shape our programs, partnerships, and engagement with our community.</p>		\n			<h2>The Faces Behind the Foundation</h2>		\n		<p>Fursa Foundation is driven by a team of passionate individuals who are committed to making a difference.</p>		\n													<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman1.png 512w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />													\n			<h6>Idda Mihindi</h6>		\n			<h6>Co-Founder, CEO</h6>		\n		<p>Leads Fursa Foundation with a passion for empowering women and creating sustainable change.</p>		\n													<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman2.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman2.png 512w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman2-300x300.png 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman2-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />													\n			<h6>Monica Ally Lucas</h6>		\n			<h6>Production Manager</h6>		\n		<p>Oversees production, ensuring quality reusable pads and empowering young women in the process</p>		\n													<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman3.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman3.png 512w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman3-300x300.png 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/woman3-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />													\n			<h6>Salome Charles Mwafungo</h6>		\n			<h6>Marketing Manager</h6>		\n		<p>Drives awareness, sharing impactful stories to connect with and engage our community.</p>		\n			<h2>Creating Lasting Change</h2>		\n		<p>At Fursa Foundation, our work goes beyond providing resources; it’s about creating meaningful, long-term change in the lives of women and girls across Tanzania.</p>		\n			<h5>WASH Program</h5>		\n		<p>We’re committed to breaking the barriers that prevent girls from attending school and participating fully in their communities due to a lack of menstrual hygiene products.<br /><br />Through our WASH Program, we have not only provided reusable sanitary pads but also educated young girls on menstrual health, helping them regain confidence and dignity.</p>		\n			Sanitary Provided			\n				0\n				+\n			Hygiene Workshops			\n				0\n				+\n			Job opportunities			\n				0\n				+\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH.jpg 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Copy-of-PHOTO3.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Copy-of-PHOTO3.jpeg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Copy-of-PHOTO3-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Copy-of-PHOTO3-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h5>Women Empowerment Program</h5>		\n		<p>Empowerment is at the heart of everything we do. Through training in entrepreneurship, digital skills, and financial literacy, we’re equipping women with the tools they need to become self-reliant and economically independent. <br /><br />This program has helped many women start their own businesses, turning dreams into reality</p>		\n			Women Trained			\n				0\n				+\n			Women-led Businesses			\n				0\n				+\n			Women employed			\n				0\n				+\n			<h5>Ending GBV Program</h5>		\n		<p>We believe that every woman and girl has the right to live free from violence and fear. <br /><br />Through awareness campaigns, workshops, and support services, we’re working to change attitudes, promote gender equality, and create safer environments for women and girls.</p>		\n			Awareness Sessions			\n				0\n				+\n			Supported Survivors			\n				0\n				+\n			Youths Reached			\n				0\n				+\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV.jpg 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h2>Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>		\n		<p>Your support can change the lives of women and girls in Tanzania. Whether it’s through donating, volunteering, or partnering with us, you can be a part of this journey.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									Donate\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									Volunteer\n					</a>\n			<h6>Fursa Foundation</h6>		\n		<p>We are dedicated to empowering adolescents, young women, and underserved communities through initiatives that promote menstrual hygiene, women’s entrepreneurship, and gender equality.</p>		\n			<h6>Quick Links</h6>		\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/homepage/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n											Programs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n											 About Us\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n											Get Involved\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h6>Contacts</h6>		\n		<p>info@fursafoundation.com<br />+255 782 762 992<br />Mwanza, Tanzania</p>		\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Facebook\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.