(299, 1, '2024-10-25 11:55:51', '2024-10-25 11:55:51', '<h1>Empowering Women and Girls in Tanzania to Thrive</h1>		\n		<p>Join us in building a future where every woman and girl has the resources, knowledge, and support to reach their full potential.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n									Learn More About Us\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n									Support Our Work\n					</a>\n			<h2>Fursa <br>\nFoundation</h2>		\n		<p>Fursa Foundation is a community-based organization founded by young medical doctors in Mwanza, Tanzania, We are dedicated to empowering adolescents, young women, and underserved communities through initiatives that promote menstrual hygiene, women’s entrepreneurship, and gender equality.</p>		\n													<img width=\"635\" height=\"423\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg 635w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 635px) 100vw, 635px\" />													\n			<h2>What We Believe</h2>		\n		<p>Inspired by the challenges faced by women and girls in rural Tanzania, a group of young doctors decided to take action. <br /><br />We witnessed firsthand how the lack of access to menstrual hygiene products, limited economic opportunities, and the prevalence of gender-based violence were holding back women and girls from reaching their full potential. <br /><br />With a shared vision of creating a healthier, more equitable society, we established Fursa Foundation to address these challenges head-on. <br /><br />Today, we’re proud to be making a difference in the lives of thousands of women and girls across Tanzania, one step at a time.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n									Read Our Story\n					</a>\n			<h2>Our Programs</h2>		\n		<p>At Fursa Foundation, we focus on creating sustainable change through three core programs that address the most pressing challenges faced by women and girls in Tanzania.</p>		\n			<h3>W.A.S.H Program</h3>		\n		<p>Access to safe, affordable menstrual hygiene products remains a significant challenge for many young women and girls in Tanzania, especially in rural communities. <br /><br />Through our WASH Program, we provide high-quality, reusable sanitary pads, known as \'Fursa Pads,\' along with comprehensive menstrual hygiene education. We work closely with schools, healthcare providers, and community leaders to ensure that every girl has the knowledge and resources to manage her period with dignity</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg 967w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h3>Women Empowerment</h3>		\n		<p>We believe that empowering women with the right skills and knowledge is key to creating lasting change. Our Women Empowerment Program offers training in entrepreneurship, digital literacy, and financial management, enabling young mothers and women to start their own businesses or secure employment. <br /><br />By providing mentorship, resources, and practical skills training, we’re helping women gain confidence, become self-reliant, and contribute positively to their communities.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women.jpg 1114w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h3>Ending Gender-Based Violence</h3>		\n		<p>Gender-based violence remains a critical issue in Tanzania, affecting the health, safety, and future of women and girls. Our Ending GBV Program works with communities to raise awareness, promote respectful relationships, and advocate for women’s rights. <br /><br />Through workshops, youth engagement programs, and collaboration with local authorities, we are educating communities on the importance of gender equality and creating safe spaces for survivors to seek help and support.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training.jpg 1088w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h2>Our Impact to<br> the community</h2>		\n		<p>Together with our supporters, we’ve been able to make a significant impact in the lives of women and girls across Tanzania. Here’s a glimpse of what we’ve achieved so far</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_49\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_49)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_49)\"><rect x=\"-26\" width=\"539\" height=\"531\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_49\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_49\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_49\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				50\n				+\n		<p>girls provided with reusable sanitary pads</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_48\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_48)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_48)\"><rect width=\"539\" height=\"480\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_48\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_48\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_48\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>women trained in entrepreneurship skills</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_50\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_50)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_50)\"><rect x=\"-13\" y=\"16\" width=\"539\" height=\"480\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_50\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_50\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_50\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>workshops conducted to raise awareness about GBV.</p>		\n			<h2>What We’ve Been Up To</h2>		\n		<p>Take a look at some of the activities and events that keep us busy as we work towards empowering our communities.</p>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg 967w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h5>Menstrual Hygiene Workshop</h5>		\n		<p>Workshops to teach young girls and women about menstrual hygiene, providing them with reusable sanitary pads.</p>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/training-1.jpg 1088w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h5>Community Outreach on Gender Equality</h5>		\n		<p>Our team engages with local communities to raise awareness about gender equality.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/92837ae996800e72f3a3ec702304fbd9.svg\" alt=\"92837ae996800e72f3a3ec702304fbd9.svg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/0fb359f3bd260453bc77a509dcd37a72.svg\" alt=\"0fb359f3bd260453bc77a509dcd37a72.svg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/467a12693b852f1a54be646cc77c66df.svg\" alt=\"467a12693b852f1a54be646cc77c66df.svg\" /></figure>			\n			<h2>What Our Beneficiaries Say</h2>		\n		<p>Hearing directly from those we’ve impacted is one of the most powerful ways to understand the difference we’re making.</p>		\n		<p>“Fursa Foundation’s reusable pads have made it possible for me to attend school without worrying. Now, I can focus on my education and participate in class with confidence. I no longer feel embarrassed or anxious during my period, and I know that I’m supported.”</p>		\n			<h6>Aisha, 15</h6>		\n													<img width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-4.jpg 1080w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-4-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" />													\n			<h2>Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>		\n		<p>Your support can change the lives of women and girls in Tanzania. Whether it’s through donating, volunteering, or partnering with us, you can be a part of this journey.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n									Donate\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n									Volunteer\n					</a>\n			<h6>Fursa Foundation</h6>		\n		<p>We are dedicated to empowering adolescents, young women, and underserved communities through initiatives that promote menstrual hygiene, women’s entrepreneurship, and gender equality.</p>		\n			<h6>Quick Links</h6>		\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/homepage/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n											Programs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n											 About Us\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n											Get Involved\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h6>Contacts</h6>		\n		<p>info@fursafoundation.com<br />+255 782 762 992<br />Mwanza, Tanzania</p>		\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Facebook\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 39