oads/2024/10/Students-Photo.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Students-Photo.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Students-Photo.jpg 1020w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Students-Photo-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Students-Photo-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"97c8e55\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"nudba 3\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmZ1cnNhZm91bmRhdGlvbi5vcmdcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzEwXC9udWRiYS0zLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijk3YzhlNTUifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3.jpg 967w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/nudba-3-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"97c8e55\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"img2\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE0LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmZ1cnNhZm91bmRhdGlvbi5vcmdcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzEwXC9pbWcyLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6Ijk3YzhlNTUifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg\'><img width=\"635\" height=\"423\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg 635w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 635px) 100vw, 635px\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"97c8e55\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"fursafoundation-img-1-3\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTA5LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvd3d3LmZ1cnNhZm91bmRhdGlvbi5vcmdcL3dwLWNvbnRlbnRcL3VwbG9hZHNcLzIwMjRcLzEwXC9mdXJzYWZvdW5kYXRpb24taW1nLTEtMy5qcGciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiI5N2M4ZTU1In0%3D\" href=\'https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fursafoundation-img-1-3.jpg\'><img width=\"630\" height=\"420\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fursafoundation-img-1-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fursafoundation-img-1-3.jpg 630w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/fursafoundation-img-1-3-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n			<h6>Fursa Foundation</h6>		\n		<p>We are dedicated to empowering adolescents, young women, and underserved communities through initiatives that promote menstrual hygiene, women’s entrepreneurship, and gender equality.</p>		\n			<h6>Quick Links</h6>		\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/homepage/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n											Programs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n											 About Us\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n											Get Involved\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h6>Contacts</h6>		\n		<p>info@fursafoundation.com<br />+255 782 762 992<br />Mwanza, Tanzania</p>		\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Facebook\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Twitter\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 