(339, 1, '2024-10-28 17:46:21', '2024-10-28 17:46:21', '<p>Discover how our programs are creating sustainable change for women and girls in Tanzania.</p>		\n			<h2>Empowering Women, Changing Lives</h2>		\n			<h2>Transforming<br> Communities</h2>		\n		<p>Our programs are designed to address the unique challenges. By focusing on menstrual hygiene, economic empowerment, and gender equality, we are creating opportunities for women to lead healthier, more fulfilling lives.</p>		\n													<img width=\"635\" height=\"423\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2.jpg 635w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img2-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 635px) 100vw, 635px\" />													\n			<h2>Our Commitment to Change.</h2>		\n		<p>At Fursa Foundation, we believe that sustainable change begins with empowering women and girls. Through our three core programs, we address the most pressing challenges they face, from menstrual health to economic empowerment and safety. <br /><br />Each program is designed to provide practical solutions, education, and opportunities, ensuring that every woman and girl we reach is equipped to lead a healthy, productive life.</p>		\n			<h2>Our Programs</h2>		\n		<p>At Fursa Foundation, we focus on creating sustainable change through three core programs that address the most pressing challenges faced by women and girls in Tanzania.</p>		\n			<h5>WASH Program</h5>		\n		<p>Menstrual hygiene remains a significant barrier for many girls and women in Tanzania, often leading to missed school days and limited opportunities.</p><p>Through our WASH Program, we provide reusable sanitary pads, menstrual hygiene education, and safe water solutions, empowering girls to manage their periods with dignity.</p><p><strong>Key Initiatives:</strong></p><ul><li>Distribution of reusable sanitary pads to schoolgirls and women.</li><li>Menstrual hygiene education workshops to raise awareness and knowledge.</li><li>Empowering women through training in pad production and entrepreneurship.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/WASH.jpg 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h5>Women Empowerment Program</h5>		\n		<p>We believe that empowered women create empowered communities. Our Women’s Empowerment Program provides training in entrepreneurship, digital skills, and financial literacy, helping women to build sustainable livelihoods and achieve economic independence. <br /><br />By nurturing confidence and offering mentorship, we enable women to become leaders, job creators, and positive role models in their communities.</p><p><strong>Key Initiatives:</strong></p><ul><li>Training programs in entrepreneurship, digital skills, and financial literacy.</li><li>Mentorship opportunities for women starting their own businesses.<br />Support in launching and scaling women-led enterprises.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/women.jpg 1114w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h5>Ending GBV Program</h5>		\n		<p>Our Ending Gender-Based Violence Program aims to create safer communities by educating youths, engaging men and boys, and raising awareness about women’s rights. <br /><br />We conduct workshops, community dialogues, and campaigns to promote respectful relationships, advocate for gender equality, and support survivors in their journey to healing.</p><p><strong>Key Initiatives:</strong></p><ul><li>Community workshops on gender equality and respectful relationships.</li><li>Awareness campaigns to challenge harmful norms and attitudes.</li><li>Support services and resources for survivors of gender-based violence.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.fursafoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/GBV.jpg 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n			<h2>Our Impact to<br> the community</h2>		\n		<p>Together with our supporters, we’ve been able to make a significant impact in the lives of women and girls across Tanzania. Here’s a glimpse of what we’ve achieved so far</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_49\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_49)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_49)\"><rect x=\"-26\" width=\"539\" height=\"531\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_49\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_49\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_49\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				50\n				+\n		<p>girls provided with reusable sanitary pads</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_48\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_48)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_48)\"><rect width=\"539\" height=\"480\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_48\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_48\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_48\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>women trained in entrepreneurship skills</p>		\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\"><mask id=\"mask0_116_50\" style=\"mask-type:alpha\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><rect width=\"512\" height=\"512\" fill=\"url(#pattern0_116_50)\"></rect></mask><g mask=\"url(#mask0_116_50)\"><rect x=\"-13\" y=\"16\" width=\"539\" height=\"480\" fill=\"#005CA9\"></rect></g><defs><pattern id=\"pattern0_116_50\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><use xlink:href=\"#image0_116_50\" transform=\"scale(0.00195312)\"></use></pattern><image id=\"image0_116_50\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image></defs></svg>			\n				0\n				+\n		<p>workshops conducted to raise awareness about GBV.</p>		\n			<h2>Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>		\n		<p>Your support can change the lives of women and girls in Tanzania. Whether it’s through donating, volunteering, or partnering with us, you can be a part of this journey.</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n									Donate\n					</a>\n			<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n									Volunteer\n					</a>\n			<h6>Fursa Foundation</h6>		\n		<p>We are dedicated to empowering adolescents, young women, and underserved communities through initiatives that promote menstrual hygiene, women’s entrepreneurship, and gender equality.</p>		\n			<h6>Quick Links</h6>		\n					<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/homepage/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/programs/\">\n											Programs\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/about-us/\">\n											 About Us\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://www.fursafoundation.org/get-involved/\">\n											Get Involved\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h6>Contacts</h6>		\n		<p>info@fursafoundation.com<br />+255 782 762 992<br />Mwanza, Tanzania</p>		\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Facebook\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-